# Update README note.
readme=root/'PATCH_README.txt'
rs=readme.read_text(encoding='utf-8')
rs += '''\n\nNEW EVALUATOR/PRICE FIX\n- Public evaluator submission is allowed for purchaser, requisitioner, and amd_personnel when the role and PO match the pending evaluation link; evaluator Firebase/SISC login is not required.\n- Public evaluation now shows an itemized pricing section and a computed total instead of silently displaying Php 0.00 when item totals are available.\n- PO Storage supports editable transaction pricing and automatic Gemini extraction for uploaded image scans.\n- Upload/save now refreshes all pending evaluator links, including Purchasing / Buyer.\n- No new environment variables are required.\n- Deploy firestore.rules with: firebase deploy --only firestore:rules\n'''
